{"id":438,"date":"2026-01-20T05:16:16","date_gmt":"2026-01-20T05:16:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/?page_id=438"},"modified":"2026-04-08T10:26:31","modified_gmt":"2026-04-08T10:26:31","slug":"iiitb-microsoft","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/iiitb-microsoft\/","title":{"rendered":"IIITB &amp; MICROSOFT"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div id=\"inner-banner\" class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover wp-duotone-unset-1\" style=\"padding-top:5%;padding-right:5%;padding-bottom:5%;padding-left:5%;min-height:191px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2337 size-large\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DSC_2664-1-1024x683.jpg\" style=\"object-position:52% 69%\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"52% 69%\" srcset=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DSC_2664-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DSC_2664-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DSC_2664-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DSC_2664-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DSC_2664-1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-blue-background-color has-background-dim\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fa766f95 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading f-54-28 has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ff0f5ee9657f5ce4a09dff003d037f20\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase\">IIITB AND MICROSOFT<\/h1>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"m1\" class=\"wp-block-group relative is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:3%;padding-right:0%;padding-bottom:0%;padding-left:5%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group r-z1 m-pl0 m-pr5 is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:10%\"><div class=\"breadcrumb\">\r\n\r\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Glyph.png\" class=\"home-icon\" \/> \n                \n                <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"9\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 18\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M0.750039 18C0.558228 18 0.366231 17.92 0.219795 17.7603C-0.0732648 17.4406 -0.0732648 16.9229 0.219795 16.6034L7.18947 8.99999L0.219795 1.39661C-0.0732648 1.07691 -0.0732648 0.559202 0.219795 0.239702C0.512854 -0.0797984 0.987411 -0.0800029 1.28028 0.239702L8.7802 8.42153C9.07326 8.74124 9.07326 9.25894 8.7802 9.57844L1.28028 17.7603C1.13385 17.92 0.941849 18 0.750039 18Z\" fill=\"#214F94\"\/>\n<\/svg>\n\n              <\/a><span class='sep'>\/<\/span>  \r\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-bottom:5%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading sub-head wow wd wd_0.3s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-f7efb76e91a4168ef1f9a6bc4922d07f\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase\">IIITB &amp; MICROSOFT<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading sec-head wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a82dbd641e8414bf18bda166ad3dfe1c\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>A Complementary Partnership<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-64b4e967 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4d1c6129cdebc015469a94400020c75a wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">The AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative (A4I) is a collaboration between&nbsp;Microsoft&nbsp;as innovation enablers, and&nbsp;IIIT-Bangalore&nbsp;as the impact partner. The initiative combines Microsoft\u2019s cutting-edge AI capabilities and innovations with IIIT-B\u2019s expertise in research, solution-scaling and field-driven deployment to transform proven innovations into scalable Digital Public Goods (DPGs). A4I provides a structured framework for governance, partnerships, and scale, enabling high-impact AI solutions to reach underserved communities effectively.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a32af61182aba0e86abd5d45d15671ee wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">The value that each partner brings to the table is summarized below.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-bottom is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"842\" height=\"617\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/a-complement-image.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-442\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/a-complement-image.webp 842w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/a-complement-image-300x220.webp 300w, https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/a-complement-image-768x563.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 842px) 100vw, 842px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns micro-section is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2c5763e6 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-top:5%;padding-right:5%;padding-bottom:5%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/staging\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Microsoft_logo_2012.svg_-2-768x164-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2407\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-bottom:5%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading sec-head wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b781a6d54e992e41c2a834530d6884aa\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong><strong><strong>MICROSOFT<\/strong><\/strong><\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-64b4e967 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem\">Microsoft has a range of research assets in societal impact domains such as education, agriculture, healthcare, and accessibility, which have demonstrated the impact of these innovations on a small and medium scale, with some (like&nbsp;Karya) even successfully spinning off to become independent, self-sustaining entities. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem\">However, scaling these assets beyond successful pilots has been stymied by the lack of resources, a reliably supporting scaling infrastructure, and expertise at various levels.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp wp-block-paragraph\">The AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative strongly aligns with Microsoft India\u2019s strategic priorities by addressing the problems in the public-sector priority states in India. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp wp-block-paragraph\">States such as Karnataka, Telangana, or Rajasthan are directly targeted by the project interventions being scaled <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"m3\" class=\"wp-block-group relative has-black-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:5%;padding-right:5%;padding-bottom:5%;padding-left:5%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group r-z1 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-09e2a21d wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-1a3e11a6 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading sec-head wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-37d2eca5cd1ac583e69fe26511d78b37\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Microsoft brings the following strengths to A4I<\/strong><\/h2>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list ul-grid-2\">\n<li class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8774b89fb02902123623a0aaea6c913b\">Dedicated funding from Microsoft Philanthropies&nbsp;to support scaling of technology innovations and rigorous research on societal impact.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-71381ee7af50129f721f81fa57e880ed\">Thought leadership in developing AI solutions&nbsp;for the public good, reflecting Microsoft\u2019s deep commitment to inclusion, equity, and empowering underserved communities.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-62fc35b76824d7c499760f9b819e3fb0\">A portfolio of proven, research-backed innovations&nbsp;from Microsoft Research, ready for adaptation and deployment at scale.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full l-ele\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"163\" height=\"241\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/vector-2-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-470\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"m4\" class=\"wp-block-group relative has-base-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:5%;padding-right:5%;padding-bottom:5%;padding-left:5%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group r-z1 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-09e2a21d wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading sec-head wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp has-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9e269379ff7af92601ec44f97b579094\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>International Institute of Information Technology, Bangalore (IIIT-B)<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1bff2310bb2ece2707c74731989ba76a wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">IIIT-B is a highly respected institute in contributions to DPGs, public policy and tech solutions for society.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group grid-3 is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-831b2db5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group item has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;background-color:#f2f7ff;padding-top:1.25rem;padding-right:1.25rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;padding-left:1.25rem;background-image:url(&apos;https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/logo-vecror.webp&apos;);background-size:cover;\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a3338134dbd8b3e07ac28f6f51856a58 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">For more than 12 years, the&nbsp;<strong>Centre for Information Technology and Public Policy (CITAPP)<\/strong>&nbsp;has shaped public policy and technology design for underserved communities across education, health, agriculture, and livelihoods.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group item has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;background-color:#f2f7ff;padding-top:1.25rem;padding-right:1.25rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;padding-left:1.25rem;background-image:url(&apos;https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/logo-vecror.webp&apos;);background-size:cover;\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b0dc8f70a093a38f330153d0c1d181db wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">The&nbsp;<strong>Centre for Accessibility in the Global South (CAGS)<\/strong>&nbsp;at IIIT-B is a multidisciplinary research hub focused on inclusive design. With the Centre for Digital Public Infrastructure (CDPI) also at IIIT-B, A4I can leverage existing networks and infrastructure to scale Microsoft\u2019s technology innovations effectively.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group item has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:12px;border-bottom-left-radius:12px;border-bottom-right-radius:12px;background-color:#f2f7ff;padding-top:1.25rem;padding-right:1.25rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;padding-left:1.25rem;background-image:url(&apos;https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/logo-vecror.webp&apos;);background-size:cover;\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-fd0c702e20659303b94974a58db74d5e wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\"><strong>MOSIP&nbsp;<\/strong>(Modular Open Source Identity Platform) was incubated at IIIT-B and has been adopted in over 20 countries. IIIT-B has also scaled projects through its&nbsp;<strong>E-Health Research Centre (EHRC)<\/strong>, such as&nbsp;Tele Manas, India\u2019s flagship digital mental health initiative, handling over 10,000 calls per month.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full l-ele\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"182\" height=\"283\" src=\"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/vector-left-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-414\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>IIITB &amp; MICROSOFT A Complementary Partnership The AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative (A4I) is a collaboration between&nbsp;Microsoft&nbsp;as innovation enablers, and&nbsp;IIIT-Bangalore&nbsp;as the impact partner. The initiative combines Microsoft\u2019s cutting-edge AI capabilities and innovations with IIIT-B\u2019s expertise in research, solution-scaling and field-driven deployment to transform proven innovations into scalable Digital Public Goods (DPGs). A4I provides a structured [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":391,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-438","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/438","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=438"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/438\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2436,"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/438\/revisions\/2436"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/391"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/a4i.iiitb.ac.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=438"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}